# ==============================================================================
# THE TEMPLATE PACK - ITS SHARE OF THE SHARED DEFAULTS
# ==============================================================================
# Read at install: every uncommented NAME=value here is merged into
# ~/.config/gmake/env.global when the key is not already set there - and
# env.project.sample does the same for a project's .env.global. A sample
# that ships nothing (this one) merges nothing.
#
# The template sets nothing. One looks like this:
#
# MY_PACK_TOOL=my-tool
